 	uint32_t ct1 = 0, ct2 = 0, ct3 = 0, ct4 = 0, plist = 0, flag = 0xffffffff;
-	// The high half of the mask is the zones of one opponent. With more than two duelists it is the next living
-	// duelist in turn order: the seat that the EFFECT_DISABLE_FIELD code (add_disabled_zones_n) binds the high half
-	// to, so the zones that are offered are the zones that get disabled. It is skipped when nobody else lives or
-	// that seat is on the same team. (SelectFieldZone is different: its result is read back with 1-tp, so it uses
-	// the bound opponent.)
+	// The high half of the mask is the zones of one opponent. With more than two duelists it is the one that the zone
+	// prompts of the scope duelist use (f8_place_target: the bound opponent of the link, else the next living opponent),
+	// the same opponent that an EFFECT_DISABLE_FIELD effect made from the result binds its high half to
